OL,3,AMicrosoft says AI rival Anthropic could
OL,4,Ahave 'disastrous impact' on humanity
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe comments are the latest in a series
OL,7,Fof stark warnings from the AI industry
OL,8,Fon the possible dangers of the
OL,9,Ftechnology. The BBC has contacted
OL,10,FAnthropic for comment.
